(P(B_{1}),...,P(B_{k}))\sim\mathrm{Dirichlet}(\alpha_{0}P_{0}(B_{1}),...,\alpha_{0}P_{0}(B_{k}))
\]

\end_inset

where 
\begin_inset Formula $P_{0}$
\end_inset

 is a fixed probability measure (e.g.
 
\begin_inset Formula $N(0,1)$
\end_inset

).
\begin_inset VSpace medskip
\end_inset


