closed under summation or splitting
\series default
\color inherit
 of bins.
 
\begin_inset Newline newline
\end_inset


\begin_inset Formula $\Rightarrow$
\end_inset

 consistent definition of a 
\series bold
\color blue
stochastic process
\series default
\color inherit
.
 c.f.
 GPs.
