\end_inset

 is 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\mathrm{Dirichlet}\left(\alpha_{0}P_{0}(B_{1})+\sum_{i=1}^{n}1_{y_{i}\in B_{1}},...,\alpha_{0}P_{0}(B_{k})+\sum_{i=1}^{n}1_{y_{i}\in B_{k}}\right)
